="#producto">The product</a><a href="#caminos">For owners</a><a href="#precios">Pricing</a><a href="#preguntas">FAQ</a></nav><div class="hdr-right"><div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Idioma"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">ES</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">EN</button></div><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/en#avisame">Join the list</a></div></div></header><main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col"><section class="band hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">For real estate agents in Costa Rica</p><h1>One place for your listings, your clients and your closings.</h1><p class="lede">IkiHomes is the working platform for Costa Rican real estate agents: organised inventory, buyer enquiries, and every deal tracked to closing without anything getting lost in a chat thread.</p><div class="cta-row"><a href="#avisame" class="btn btn-primary">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#producto">See the product</a></div><p class="p-note">Sign-up is not open yet. Leave your email and we will tell you the moment you can create your account.</p><div class="trust-row"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>No credit card</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Free plan, no expiry</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Built in Costa Rica</span></div></div><div class="hero-shot"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-bar"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="frame-url">app.ikihomescr.com/agent/dashboard</span></div><img alt="The IkiHomes agent dashboard, showing buyer requests, visits and pipeline status" width="1661" height="920" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 720px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="shot-tag">Actual product screen</span></div></div></section><section class="band bg-surface" id="producto"><div class="wrap"><div class="proof-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The product</p><h2>Not a promise. Already built.</h2></div><p class="lede">A two-minute tour of the portal and real screens, not illustrations.</p></div><div class="proof-video-block"><div class="proof-video"><button type="button" class="proof-video-play" aria-label="Watch how it works in 2 minutes (in Spanish)"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1240px) 100vw, 1160px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcomo-funciona-agentes.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="proof-video-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5.14v13.72a1 1 0 0 0 1.52.85l10.98-6.86a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.7L9.52 4.29A1 1 0 0 0 8 5.14Z"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="proof-video-cta"><p>This is how you will work in IkiHomes. During prelaunch, the first 20 agents on the list receive an invitation with 2 months of Realtor Pro free, no card required.</p><a href="#avisame" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Join the list</a></div></div><div class="proof-grid"><article class="proof-card"><div class="proof-media"><img alt="The IkiHomes agent dashboard" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 380px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-dashboard-real.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="proof-body"><span class="tag">Dashboard</span><h4>Your day, at a glance</h4><p>Open requests in your zones, this week&#x27;s viewings and the state of your pipeline, all on one screen.</p></div></article><article class="proof-card"><div class="proof-media"><img alt="Incoming buyer requests in the agent&#x27;s zones" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 380px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fikiradar.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="proof-body"><span class="tag">Requests</span><h4>Buyers looking for you</h4><p>When a buyer posts what they are looking for in your zone, the request reaches the radar of the Pro agents in that zone. Only the first 3 to respond take it.</p></div></article><article class="proof-card"><div class="proof-media"><img alt="The client pipeline board in IkiHomes" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 380px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Flead2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="proof-body"><span class="tag">Clients</span><h4>No client goes cold</h4><p>Every enquiry lands on the board and moves through stages to closing, with notes and reminders.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="band" id="caminos"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Two ways in</p><h2 style="max-width:20ch;margin-bottom:44px">You sell other people&#x27;s property, or you sell your own.</h2><div class="doors"><div class="door door-main"><p class="eyebrow on-band" style="margin-bottom:4px">Real estate agent</p><h3 style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px)">You work with clients every day</h3><p>List your inventory, take enquiries, follow up and arrange viewings. IkiHomes is a working tool, not another portal charging you to appear.</p><div class="allow">10 <small>published listings, free</small></div><ul><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>A verifiable professional profile</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Buyer enquiries straight to your inbox</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Viewing requests with the times the buyer proposes</li></ul><a class="btn btn-onband" style="align-self:flex-start;margin-top:6px" href="#avisame">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="door door-alt"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:4px">Property owner</p><h3 style="font-size:clamp(22px,1.9vw,26px)">You have one property and you want to sell it</h3><p>List your property, show it properly, and talk directly to whoever asks. No platform commission.</p><div class="allow">1 <small>active listing, free</small></div><a class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self:flex-start" href="#avisame">Join the list</a><div class="door-photo"><img alt="Homes on a Costa Rican hillside at sunset." loading="lazy" width="1100" height="618" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fdoor-lifestyle.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoor-lifestyle.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fdoor-lifestyle.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band bg-brandsoft"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">What you do inside</p><h2 style="max-width:22ch;margin-bottom:44px">The same work, without the usual mess.</h2><div class="feat"><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><path d="M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5V20a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-6H9v6H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"></path></svg><h4>Inventory in order</h4><p>Every property in one place, with photos, prices and status kept current.</p></div><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><path d="m8.6 13.5 6.8 4M15.4 6.5l-6.8 4"></path></svg><h4>Links worth sending</h4><p>Send one clean listing over WhatsApp instead of twelve loose photos and a heavy PDF.</p></div><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path></svg><h4>Client follow-up</h4><p>Every enquiry is recorded and moves through stages until it closes.</p></div><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"></path></svg><h4>Viewings that stick</h4><p>The client proposes 2 or 3 times, you confirm one, and both of you keep the record.</p></div><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><path d="M12 3 20 6v6c0 4.5-3.2 7.9-8 9-4.8-1.1-8-4.5-8-9V6z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h4>Trust in plain sight</h4><p>Your response badge and, if you have it, the Verified by IkiHomes badge are visible to whoever contacts you.</p></div><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="ico"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.4"></circle><path d="M5 20c0-3.6 3.1-5.6 7-5.6s7 2 7 5.6"></path></svg><h4>Your professional presence</h4><p>A public page with your photo, your bio, your zones and all your listings. The link you send when someone asks who you are.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="band" id="precios"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2 style="max-width:18ch;margin-bottom:14px">Free to start. Pro when you need it.</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:44px">One paid plan, one price. No lock-in and no fine print.</p><div class="plans"><div class="plan plan-free"><div class="plan-head"><h3>Free</h3></div><div class="price">$0<small> /mo</small></div><p style="font-size:15.5px">To get your inventory in order and start taking enquiries.</p><ul><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Public profile with your contact details</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Buyer enquiries in your inbox</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Viewing requests</li></ul><div class="split-note"><span><b>If you are an agent:</b> up to 10 published listings.</span><span><b>If you are an owner:</b> 1 active listing. Write to us if you need more.</span></div><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#avisame">Join the list</a></div><div class="plan plan-pro"><span class="ribbon">For working agents</span><div class="plan-head"><h3>Realtor Pro</h3></div><div class="price">$49<small> /mo</small></div><p class="ref">Billed in US dollars. Colón figure shown at the day&#x27;s exchange rate.</p><p style="font-size:15.5px">Everything in the free plan, plus the closing tools.</p><ul><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Unlimited published listings</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Private listings with a shareable link</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Your brand on every link you share</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>AI review of your listings, every day</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Client pipeline: reply to enquiries and confirm viewings</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg>Buyer requests in your zones</li></ul><p class="ref">During prelaunch, the first 20 agents on the list receive 2 months of Realtor Pro free. No card and no automatic charge.</p><a class="btn btn-onband" href="#avisame">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="rail"><div class="rail-head"><h3>How the prelaunch works</h3><span>We are finishing the last details. Leave your email and we will write on the day we open.</span></div><div class="steps"><div class="step" data-n="1"><h4>You leave your email</h4><p>No spam. If you are among the first 20 agents, you get our invitation with 2 months of Pro. If not, one email when we open.</p></div><div class="step" data-n="2"><h4>We write when we open</h4><p>With the link to create your account and start listing.</p></div><div class="step" data-n="3"><h4>You list from day one</h4><p>Your profile and your properties ready before you share the first link.</p></div></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#avisame" style="margin-top:26px">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="band bg-surface" id="preguntas"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 style="max-width:16ch;margin-bottom:36px">What people ask us.</h2><div class="faq"><details open=""><summary>How do I pay for Realtor Pro?</summary><p>By card from your dashboard, or by SINPE Móvil and bank transfer if that suits you better. It is billed monthly in US dollars and you can cancel whenever you want, with no penalty.</p></details><details><summary>Does the free plan expire?</summary><p>No. Use it for as long as you like. If you ever need the closing tools, you move to Pro.</p></details><details><summary>Is there any way to get Pro without paying for it?</summary><p>During prelaunch, yes: the first 20 agents on the list receive an invitation with 2 months of Realtor Pro free, no card required. When it ends nothing is charged and your account returns to the free plan.</p></details><details><summary>Does IkiHomes take commission on my sales?</summary><p>No. The platform takes no part in the negotiation and takes no percentage. The only charge is the monthly Pro subscription.</p></details><details><summary>I am an owner, not an agent. Can I still use it?</summary><p>Yes. You create an owner account and list your property. The free plan includes one active listing. If you have several, write to us and we will sort it out.</p></details><details><summary>What are private listings?</summary><p>Properties you load into the system that never appear in public search. You generate a link and share it only with whoever you choose.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel whenever I want?</summary><p>Yes, with no penalty. You keep your free account and lose no property: anything above the free plan&#x27;s limit becomes a draft until you reactivate.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="signup" id="avisame"><div class="wrap"><div class="signup-copy"><p class="eyebrow on-band">Prelaunch</p><h2>Two months of Pro for the first 20 agents.</h2><p class="lede">Leave your name and email, and tell us how you will use IkiHomes. During prelaunch, the first 20 agents on the list receive an invitation from us with 2 months of Realtor Pro free: no card and no automatic charge. Afterwards you stay on the free plan or move to Pro for $49 a month.</p><p class="zones" style="margin-top:18px">No credit card · Free plan, no expiry</p></div><div class="signup-card"><h3>Sign up</h3><form action="javascript:throw new Error(&#x27;React form unexpectedly submitted.&#x27;)"><input type="text" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;width:0;height:0;opacity:0;padding:0;border:0" name="company"/><div><label for="av-name">Name</label><input id="av-name" type="text" required="" autoComplete="name" maxLength="80" placeholder="Your name" style="margin-top:8px;width:100%" name="name"/></div><div><label for="av-mail">Email address</label><input id="av-mail" type="email" required="" placeholder="you@email.com" style="margin-top:8px;width:100%" name="email"/></div><div class="roles" role="group" aria-label="How you will use IkiHomes"><label><input type="radio" name="role" checked="" value="agente"/>I am a real estate agent</label><label><input type="radio" name="role" value="propietario"/>I have a property to sell</label></div><button class="btn btn-onband" type="submit" style="justify-self:stretch">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></button><p class="micro">No spam: your invitation if you are among the first 20 agents, and the launch notice. You can opt out whenever you want.</p></form></div></div></section></main><footer class="site"><div class="wrap"><div class="foot"><svg class="logo" role="img" aria-label="IkiHomes" width="1027" height="223" viewBox="0 0 1027 223" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_35_98)"><path d=