06.18 130.54H220.37V169.9Z" fill="#23696A"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_35_98"><rect width="1026.03" height="222.92" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></a><div class="hdr-right"><div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Idioma"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">ES</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">EN</button></div><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/en#avisame">Join the list</a></div></div></header><main><section class="post-head"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Blog"><a href="/en">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span class="here">Blog</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Articles for agents</p><h1>The market, without the gloss.</h1><p class="lede">Zone data, buyer profiles and what actually moves a deal in Costa Rica. Written for the agent who works.</p></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><article class="feature"><div class="feature-media"><img alt="" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 55vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-compradores-internacionales-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="feature-body"><span class="tag">Featured</span><h2>International buyers in Costa Rica: what this opportunity means for real estate agents</h2><p>International buyers Costa Rica 2026: the FDI macro context, buyer profiles, and how agents prepare to capture this flow professionally.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-05-05">May 4, 2026</time></div><a class="feature-link" href="/en/blog/compradores-internacionales-2026">Read article<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></article><div class="post-grid"><a class="post-card" href="/en/blog/guanacaste-2026"><div class="post-media"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-guanacaste-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="post-body"><span class="tag">Guanacaste</span><h3>Guanacaste in 2026: the beach opportunity for agents who understand international buyers</h3><p>Guanacaste real estate market 2026: the price correction, international-buyer profiles, and the operational window for focused agents.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-04-24">April 23, 2026</time></div></div></a><a class="post-card" href="/en/blog/santa-ana-mercado-silencioso"><div class="post-media"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-santa-ana-mercado-silencioso.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="post-body"><span class="tag">Santa Ana</span><h3>Santa Ana: the quietly growing market (and the agents already capturing it)</h3><p>Santa Ana real estate market 2026: data, buyer profiles, and the opportunity for agents positioning early in Costa Rica&#x27;s quietly growing corridor.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-04-24">April 23, 2026</time></div></div></a><a class="post-card" href="/en/blog/mls-costa-rica-reality"><div class="post-media"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-mls-costa-rica-reality.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="post-body"><span class="tag">Market</span><h3>Costa Rica has MLS, but not the way you think</h3><p>Costa Rica has MLS systems, but none are mandatory or cover the whole market. How this fragmentation impacts your business and what you can do.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-04-03">April 2, 2026</time></div></div></a><a class="post-card" href="/en/blog/escazu-2026"><div class="post-media"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-escazu-2026.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="post-body"><span class="tag">Escazú</span><h3>Escazú real estate in 2026: what every agent must know</h3><p>Analysis of the Escazú 2026 real estate market. Price trends, growth projections, international buyer profiles, and opportunities for agents.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-04-01">March 31, 2026</time></div></div></a><a class="post-card" href="/en/blog/stand-out-agent"><div class="post-media"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblog-stand-out-agent.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="post-body"><span class="tag">Practice</span><h3>How to stand out as a real estate agent in Costa Rica</h3><p>Key strategies that differentiate successful agents in Costa Rica: response speed, zone expertise, and trust-building presence.</p><div class="post-meta"><time dateTime="2026-03-28">March 27, 2026</time></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class="band final"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow on-band">Prelaunch</p><h2>Position yourself before everyone else.</h2><p>Leave your email. During prelaunch, the first 20 agents on the list receive 2 months of Realtor Pro free.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-onband" href="/en#avisame">Join the list<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><p class="zones">No credit card · Free plan, no expiry</p></div></section></main><footer class="site"><div class="wrap"><div class="foot"><svg class="logo" role="img" aria-label="IkiHomes" width="1027" height="223" viewBox="0 0 1027 223" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_35_98)"><path d="M314.64 82.8698C311.18 82.8698 308.26 81.7298 305.89 79.4498C303.52 77.1698 302.33 74.2998 302.33 70.8398C302.33 67.3798 303.52 64.5898 305.89 62.2798C308.26 59.9698 311.15 58.8198 314.55 58.8198C317.95 58.8198 320.82 59.9698 323.16 62.2798C325.5 64.5898 326.67 67.4398 326.67 70.8398C326.67 74.2398 325.52 77.1698 323.21 79.4498C320.9 81.7298 318.05 82.8698 314.65 82.8698H314.64ZM302.71 95.2798H326.18V191.48H302.71V95.2798Z" fill="#091120"></path><path d="M430.37 191.48H403.34L381.41 153.67L367.94 169.73V191.47H344.47V47.1799H367.94V133.28L399.78 95.2799H430.47L397.47 134.63L430.37 191.48Z" fill="#091120"></path><path d="M454.51 82.8698C451.05 82.8698 448.13 81.7298 445.76 79.4498C443.39 77.1698 442.2 74.2998 442.2 70.8398C442.2 67.3798 443.39 64.5898 445.76 62.2798C448.13 59.9698 451.02 58.8198 454.42 58.8198C457.82 58